			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711280201,
					"content": "「等这棵树长大一些，我便把叶子摘了，研茶给你们喝。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711280202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711280202,
					"content": "「到时候就在这里，把留云借风、理水叠山他们都叫来…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711280203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711280203,
					"content": "「你把树随随便便种在我的地界上，还好意思说这种话…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711280204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711280204,
					"content": "…昔时的诺言最终未能迎来兑现的一日，无言的古树却依然记得诺言的样貌…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711280205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711280205,
					"content": "…如今的茶香，早已飘遍沉玉谷的山野，飘向更遥远的彼方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		}
	]
